      "start_seconds": 1.08,
      "end_seconds": 4.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I think it's my turn."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.77,
      "end_seconds": 11.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.59,
      "end_seconds": 17.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "It's being thirsty. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.98,
      "end_seconds": 21.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.55,
      "end_seconds": 37.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.66,
      "end_seconds": 70.65,
      "duration_seconds": 16.99,
      "text": "Okay: height 153 centimetres, weight 56 kilos. And heart rate 66, respiratory rate 15, temperature is 36.5 degrees, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, BMI works out to 23.9, blood pressure 127 over 77."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.72,
      "end_seconds": 74.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.71,
      "end_seconds": 78.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "I'll interpret them after the examination"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.58,
      "end_seconds": 79.49,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "Right, right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.13,
      "end_seconds": 106.59,
      "duration_seconds": 14.46,
      "text": "I've also been passing kidney stones, since yesterday. And there's constipation as well, six months now. About constipation, maybe a five out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.79,
      "end_seconds": 112.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "a a few quick ones: fever, low mood or fractures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.21,
      "end_seconds": 115.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.91,
      "end_seconds": 119.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Did you notice any weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.52,
      "end_seconds": 122.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "No. No weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.49,
      "end_seconds": 126.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.6,
      "end_seconds": 129.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.83,
      "end_seconds": 133.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.65,
      "end_seconds": 138.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Propranolol, 40 milligrams, maybe, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.51,
      "end_seconds": 142.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Is the packet here, or the prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.83,
      "end_seconds": 147.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.68,
      "end_seconds": 153.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.54,
      "end_seconds": 164.91,
      "duration_seconds": 10.37,
      "text": "Yes, I had my womb taken out, fifteen years ago. I didn't want to to bother you but it keeps coming back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.26,
      "end_seconds": 180.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "let's talk a little about your daily life and habits"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.97,
      "end_seconds": 193.72,
      "duration_seconds": 12.75,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother. I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours. I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.3,
      "end_seconds": 199.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.6,
      "end_seconds": 202.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.09,
      "text": "Yes, erythromycin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.6,
      "end_seconds": 224.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.67,
      "end_seconds": 233.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I've had depression for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.33,
      "end_seconds": 236.03,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.03,
      "end_seconds": 244.57,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "well, yes, migraines i thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.84,
      "end_seconds": 251.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "Okay, I can see depression and migraines in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.26,
      "end_seconds": 257.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.9,
      "end_seconds": 261.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.73,
      "end_seconds": 282.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Your examination is normal and there is no tenderness over the bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.47,
      "end_seconds": 301.67,
      "duration_seconds": 16.2,
      "text": "okay, that's enough for me let me tell you where I've got to this is probably possible raised calcium from an overactive parathyroid it could also be vitamin D excess, so we'll keep that open"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.2,
      "end_seconds": 304.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.08,
      "end_seconds": 319.3,
      "duration_seconds": 14.22,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like possible raised calcium from an overactive parathyroid. Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had being thirsty, and no low mood or weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.37,
      "end_seconds": 322.07,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.19,
      "end_seconds": 338.41,
      "duration_seconds": 13.22,
      "text": "drink plenty of water and avoid calcium supplements until the results and please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.56,
      "end_seconds": 343.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Well, I know what to watch for."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.01,
      "end_seconds": 347.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.49,
      "end_seconds": 355.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
